# Upgrades (hard rule)

Never live `dnf update`. Replace nodes only.

| On every replace | Intentional |
|------------------|-------------|
| Latest Rocky/OS via `package_upgrade` | Bump `kubernetes_repo_version` to move kube **minors** |
| Latest kube **patch** in locked channel (e.g. v1.34 → 1.34.x) | Kubernetes **major** stays 1.x; stable only |

CP: `./scripts/replace-control-plane.sh <cp-N>`  
Workers: add slot → apply → drain/delete old → remove slot → apply

Docs: `01-cluster/README.md`
